  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: how can someone sleep through that T~T, did u not witness Maa Mulli?
  - speaker: Father
    portrait: {fileID: 7375317777126769463, guid: 272dca85da3c38040b98ff370ed98dcd, type: 3}
    text: Is this also one of your unfunny cringy jokes? i saw nothing
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: '*Edumnd Whispers

      (dear dev this is not how you write a plot twist
      T~T)'
  - speaker: Father
    portrait: {fileID: 7375317777126769463, guid: 272dca85da3c38040b98ff370ed98dcd, type: 3}
    text: 'What are you BLABBBERING ABOUT >:(

      Go and get some new seeds from
      the market rn! '
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: But i...
